00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:14,797
The patient underwent a surgical procedure to treat a metatarsal condition.

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:30,892
A scalpel was used to make an incision on the skin of the foot, followed by multiple osteotomies on the first metatarsal using a bone saw and an oscillating saw.

3
00:00:31,192 --> 00:00:35,616
A drilling procedure was then performed on the first metatarsal.
